# No active Trivy exceptions ship in FT-07.
# If an exception is approved, use .github/security/.trivyignore.yaml with
# exact vulnerability ID, package, reason, owner and expired_at.
# Do not use an unbounded .trivyignore list, --ignore-unfixed or global filters.
# Example policy description (not an active ignore entry):
# ID: CVE-YYYY-NNNN; package: foo; owner: @maintainer;
# reason: reviewed false positive; expires: YYYY-MM-DD.
